      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Una mujer caía del cielo, y una bandada de gansos voló a su encuentro.",
          "en": "A woman was falling from the sky, and a flock of geese flew up to meet her."
        },
        {
          "es": "En algunas versiones eran cisnes o garzas.",
          "en": "In some tellings, they were swans or herons."
        },
        {
          "es": "Volaron ala con ala, tan juntos que sus lomos hicieron un colchón de plumas.",
          "en": "They flew wing to wing, so close that their backs made a soft bed of feathers."
        },
        {
          "es": "La Mujer del Cielo aterrizó con suavidad. Pero los gansos no vuelan para siempre, y no había tierra.",
          "en": "Sky Woman landed gently. But geese cannot fly forever, and there was no land anywhere."
        }
      ],
